/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 514 0 R
/E (At present, most property-related activities are still managed in a traditional way. Owners keep physical notes or rely on direct communication to record property details. Students and working individuals usually depend on brokers, friends, or word-of-mouth to find hostels, PGs, or rental rooms.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
