191 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 515 0 R
/E (Since there is no digital framework, information about availability, pricing, or occupancy often becomes outdated or inconsistent. Bookings and payments are managed informally, leaving no traceable proof in case of misunderstandings. This manual approach leads to delays, confusion, and a lack of transparency in property management.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
