/E (The Property Recommendation System efficiently streamlines the process of discovering and booking residential properties, including rental apartments, PGs, and hostels. By leveraging Java-based object-oriented programming along with MySQL database management, the system ensures robustness, data integrity, and ease of maintenance. It bridges the gap between property seekers and owners by providing a user-friendly and transparent platform, overcoming the inefficiencies of traditional property search methods.)
